&gt;&gt; AND GIVEN THE FACT THAT AT

00:07:36.923 --> 00:07:40.560 line:78%
THE LAST SHOOTING IN TEXAS THAT

00:07:39.158 --> 00:07:42.628 line:78%
THE POLICE HAD THE GUNS AND

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:44.330 line:78%
DIDN'T DO IT, AND, BOY, DOES

00:07:42.728 --> 00:07:46.032 line:78%
THAT ARGUE FOR THIS, BECAUSE IF

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:48.634 line:78%
THERE HAD BEEN A PERSON -- AND

00:07:46.132 --> 00:07:50.336 line:78%
THIS IS NOT TO CONDEMN THE

00:07:48.734 --> 00:07:51.904 line:78%
POLICE, BECAUSE THERE'S THE FOG

00:07:50.436 --> 00:07:54.106 line:78%
OF WAR ASPECT GOING ON, BUT IN

00:07:52.004 --> 00:07:56.576 line:78%
THIS FOG OF WAR THERE MIGHT BE

00:07:54.207 --> 00:07:57.677 line:78%
SOMEBODY WITHIN THAT WAR, THAT

00:07:56.676 --> 00:07:58.811 line:78%
ROOM, THAT MIGHT HAVE STOPPED

00:07:57.777 --> 00:08:01.013 line:78%
IT, AS OPPOSED TO THE PEOPLE OUT

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:12.825 line:78%
THERE.

00:08:01.113 --> 00:08:15.194 line:78%
LAST WORD, HOCHUL HAS DONE

00:08:12.925 --> 00:08:16.195 line:78%
NOTHING TO CURB THE EPIDEMIC OF

00:08:15.294 --> 00:08:17.730 line:78%
CRIME IN THIS STATE.

00:08:16.295 --> 00:08:19.365 line:78%
SHE HAS NO RIGHT TO COMPLAIN

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.833 line:78%
WHEN THE PUBLIC EMBRACES

00:08:19.465 --> 00:08:24.904 line:78%
SELF-PROTECTION AS A RIGHT.

00:08:20.933 --> 00:08:27.573 line:78%
THE FACT IS, YOU LET OUT REPEAT

00:08:25.004 --> 00:08:29.075 line:78%
DEFENDERS, YOU DEFUND, REDUCE

00:08:27.673 --> 00:08:31.310 line:78%
PENALTIES FOR GUN CRIME.

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:35.848 line:78%
FORGIVE IF I'M GOING TO TURN MY

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:36.749 line:78%
HOUSE INTO AN ARMED FORTRESS.

00:08:35.948 --> 00:08:40.553 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I DIFFER SLIGHTLY.

00:08:37.283 --> 00:08:42.588 line:78%
I THINK THE COURT, A 6-3

00:08:40.653 --> 00:08:42.955 line:78%
DECISION -- ROW WADE IS A 7-2

00:08:42.688 --> 00:08:45.658 line:78%
DECISION.

00:08:43.055 --> 00:08:46.459 line:78%
THE NUMBERS AROUND THE MAJORITY

00:08:45.758 --> 00:08:47.894 line:78%
ARE RELEVANT.

00:08:46.626 --> 00:08:49.729 line:78%
IF WE'RE GOING TO TALK ABOUT IT

00:08:47.994 --> 00:08:50.897 line:78%
WE SHOULD TALK ABOUT ALL OF IT.

00:08:49.829 --> 00:08:53.633 line:78%
I ASK MYSELF A FUNDAMENTAL

00:08:50.997 --> 00:08:58.070 line:78%
QUESTION, JUDGE, AND YOU

00:08:53.733 --> 00:09:00.406 line:78%
PRESIDED AND PROSECUTED PEOPLE,

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:02.208 line:78%
YOU FEEL SAFER TODAY KNOWING

00:09:00.506 --> 00:09:04.577 line:78%
THAT PEOPLE WILL BE ABLE TO TAKE

00:09:02.308 --> 00:09:06.479 line:78%
THEIR GUNS OUTSIDE THEIR HOMES,

00:09:04.677 --> 00:09:08.447 line:78%
WHO WE HOPE ARE SANE.

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:11.050 line:78%
I HOPE EVERYONE WHO IS OUT JUST

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:11.484 line:78%
TRYING TO PROTECT HIM OR

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.652 line:78%
HERSELF.

00:09:11.584 --> 00:09:13.953 line:78%
I'M NOT SURE I FEEL SAFER.

00:09:12.885 --> 00:09:18.124 line:78%
I WOULD POSE THE QUESTION TO THE

00:09:14.787 --> 00:09:19.292 line:78%
TABLE, TOO.

00:09:18.257 --> 00:09:20.359 line:78%
I WONDER WHERE POLICE OFFICERS

00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:21.260 line:78%
AND LAW ENFORCEMENT ARE GOING TO

00:09:20.459 --> 00:09:23.329 line:78%
COME DOWN ON THIS.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:24.430 line:78%
WHEN I WAS IN COLLEGE, LAW

00:09:23.429 --> 00:09:25.431 line:78%
ENFORCEMENT ORGANIZATIONS DIDN'T

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:26.098 line:78%
MIND COMMON-SENSE RESTRICTIONS,

00:09:25.531 --> 00:09:27.199 line:78%
BECAUSE THEY WERE CONCERNED

00:09:26.198 --> 00:09:28.301 line:78%
ABOUT CRIMINALS AND OTHERS.

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:31.037 line:78%
AND UNDERSTAND, SOMEONE WHO'S

00:09:28.401 --> 00:09:32.171 line:78%
NOT A CRIMINAL TODAY WHO TAKES A

00:09:31.137 --> 00:09:33.306 line:78%
GUN AND USES IT FOR CRIMINAL

00:09:32.271 --> 00:09:34.240 line:78%
PURPOSES BECOMES A CRIMINAL

00:09:33.406 --> 00:09:36.008 line:78%
RIGHT AFTER THAT.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:38.844 line:78%
SO I HEAR ALL THE EXCITEMENT.

00:09:36.108 --> 00:09:41.280 line:78%
AGAIN, I'M NOT HERE TO POUR

00:09:38.945 --> 00:09:43.316 line:78%
WATER ON IT, BUT I'M HERE TO

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:44.817 line:78%
OFFER A COUPLE QUESTIONS.

00:09:43.416 --> 00:09:46.719 line:78%
WHATEVER WE THINK ABOUT ADAMS,

00:09:44.917 --> 00:09:49.655 line:78%
WHATEVER WE THINK ABOUT THE

00:09:46.819 --> 00:09:52.224 line:78%
POLICE CHIEF, AND WHATEVER WE

00:09:51.257 --> 00:09:54.727 line:78%
BELIEVE ABOUT HOCHUL, I BELIEVE

00:09:52.325 --> 00:09:55.027 line:78%
THEY'RE TRYING TO MAKE THE CITY

00:09:54.827 --> 00:09:56.195 line:78%
SAFER.

00:09:55.127 --> 00:09:59.365 line:78%
THERE ARE MORE THINGS THEY

00:09:56.295 --> 00:10:01.968 line:78%
SHOULD BE DOING, BUT JUST

00:09:59.465 --> 00:10:03.869 line:78%
BECAUSE WE DON'T LIKE WHAT

00:10:02.068 --> 00:10:04.937 line:78%
THEY'RE DOING ELSEWHERE SHOULD

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:10.443 line:78%
MEAN WE SHOULD SAY IT'S RIGHT

00:10:05.037 --> 00:10:12.144 line:78%
FOR THE CITY.

00:10:10.543 --> 00:10:14.113 line:78%
I'M JUST NOT CONVINCED THAT'S

00:10:12.244 --> 00:10:14.981 line:78%
WHERE WE'RE GOING TO END UP.

00:10:14.213 --> 00:10:17.016 line:78%
AGAIN, I HOPE I'M WRONG.

00:10:15.114 --> 00:10:18.584 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THE ANSWER TO YOUR FIRST

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:24.957 line:78%
QUESTION IS, THE QUESTION BEING

00:10:19.385 --> 00:10:29.695 line:78%
DO I FEEL SAFER, THAT'S NOT THE

00:10:25.057 --> 00:10:34.200 line:78%
TEST.

00:10:30.663 --> 00:10:35.134 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WE TALK ABOUT ISSUES, ISSUES

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:36.469 line:78%
THAT IMPACT.

00:10:35.234 --> 00:10:37.370 line:78%
ONE OF THE PLAINTIFFS SAID,

00:10:36.569 --> 00:10:39.372 line:78%
LIKE, I WANT TO CARRY THIS GUN,

00:10:37.503 --> 00:10:40.406 line:78%
I LIVE IN A NEIGHBORHOOD, I HAVE

00:10:39.605 --> 00:10:40.706 line:78%
A NEIGHBORHOOD WHERE THERE'S

00:10:40.506 --> 00:10:42.475 line:78%
CRIME.

00:10:40.806 --> 00:10:42.808 line:78%
THIS GUY WANTED TO PROTECT

00:10:42.575 --> 00:10:44.410 line:78%
HIMSELF.

00:10:43.109 --> 00:10:45.444 line:78%
THE QUESTION I ASK BASED ON

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.846 line:78%
THAT, BECAUSE THAT'S AN

00:10:45.544 --> 00:10:48.147 line:78%
IMPORTANT ELEMENT TO THIS CASE,

00:10:47.013 --> 00:10:49.415 line:78%
DO WE FEEL SAFER?

00:10:48.247 --> 00:10:51.951 line:78%
AGAIN, I DON'T KNOW THE ANSWER.

00:10:49.515 --> 00:10:53.486 line:78%
RIGHT NOW I DON'T.

00:10:52.051 --> 00:10:54.720 line:78%
I HOPE I'M PROVEN WRONG.

00:10:53.586 --> 00:10:56.455 line:78%
IF I'M PROVEN WRONG, I'LL BE

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:57.356 line:78%
BACK AROUND THIS TABLE, AND SAY

00:10:56.555 --> 00:10:58.491 line:78%
YOU GUYS ARE EXACTLY RIGHT.

00:10:57.456 --> 00:10:59.625 line:78%
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT A POPULARITY

00:10:58.591 --> 00:11:01.761 line:78%
CONTEST, WHEN SOMETHING IS

00:11:00.259 --> 00:11:04.563 line:78%
GUARANTEED BY THE CONSTITUTION.

00:11:01.861 --> 00:11:07.199 line:78%
YOU SEE, IT'S NOT WHETHER OR NOT

00:11:06.732 --> 00:11:12.338 line:78%
WE AGREE.

00:11:09.135 --> 00:11:12.705 line:78%
&gt;&gt; EVEN THE CONCURRING

00:11:12.438 --> 00:11:14.940 line:78%
OPINION --

00:11:13.739 --> 00:11:15.307 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THEY SUPPORT HELLER AND

00:11:15.041 --> 00:11:16.909 line:78%
McDONALD.

00:11:15.408 --> 00:11:19.645 line:78%
I DON'T WANT TO GET INTO THE --

00:11:17.276 --> 00:11:20.579 line:78%
&gt;&gt; CAN I POINT OUT ONE THING.

00:11:20.312 --> 00:11:22.281 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:11:21.247 --> 00:11:25.351 line:78%
&gt;&gt; SOMETHING HAPPENED IN THIS

00:11:22.381 --> 00:11:27.920 line:78%
SHOW FOR THE FIRST TIME IN THE

00:11:25.451 --> 00:11:30.589 line:78%
HISTORY OF ALL OF CABLE

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:32.191 line:78%
TELEVISION, A PANEL SAYS "I

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:33.893 line:78%
DON'T KNOW THE ANSWER."

00:11:32.291 --> 00:11:36.062 line:78%
YOU NEVER HEAR A PANELIST SAY

00:11:33.993 --> 00:11:37.730 line:78%
THAT ON ANY SHOW.

00:11:36.328 --> 00:11:39.031 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO ASK THIS, THE

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:40.199 line:78%
ARGUMENT THAT YOU'RE READING

00:11:39.131 --> 00:11:42.535 line:78%
TODAY, FROM PEOPLE UPSET ABOUT

00:11:40.299 --> 00:11:43.903 line:78%
THIS DECISION, JUST WATCH UNTIL

00:11:42.635 --> 00:11:46.205 line:78%
THE DOBBS DECISION IS ANNOUNCED,

00:11:44.003 --> 00:11:47.573 line:78%
AND THEY WILL BE MAKING THE

00:11:46.305 --> 00:11:48.607 line:78%
OPPOSITE CASE TO TRY TO MAKE

00:11:47.673 --> 00:11:49.108 line:78%
THEIR CASE THERE, AND THAT WON'T

00:11:48.708 --> 00:11:51.477 line:78%
MAKE SENSE.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:51.477 line:78%
&gt;&gt; OOH

